They are portly, with twinkling eyes that move quickly from one thing to another. They speak gently, laugh often, and never exercise their wit at the expense of others. Chemistry is their particular love, and those who know them say they've never known anyone to run a better still. They even sing from time to time. They have a bright, reckless tenor that is always wandering off, looking for notes in the wrong places. More often than not they stop and laugh at themself when it happens. They are a good person, and there is no conceit in them.